OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mix of
OL,6,Fclear and cloudy periods overnight
OL,7,Fwith a few showers possible. Isolated
OL,8,Fmist or fog patches forming by dawn in
OL,9,Flight winds. Feeling slightly fresher
OL,10,Fthan last night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FBright and sunny start to
OL,13,Fthe day for many, cloudier periods
OL,14,Fdeveloping in the afternoon with the
OL,15,Fwind strengthening but staying dry for
OL,16,Fmost. Temperatures above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
