OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FClear
OL,6,Fstart to Friday, cloudier in the
OL,7,Fafternoon. Cloudy periods but
OL,8,Fremaining mostly dry on Saturday. Fog
OL,9,Fpatches Sunday morning, sunny spells
OL,10,Fto follow. Above average temperatures.
